WEBVTT

00:12:27.063 --> 00:12:30.888
we are starting, at last, to believe in ourselves again,

00:12:30.888 --> 00:12:34.729
and to believe in our capacity, each and every one of us,

00:12:34.729 --> 00:12:39.122
to build a different and a kinder future,

00:12:39.122 --> 00:12:41.545
and in my book, that's incredible.

00:12:41.545 --> 00:12:45.410
Thank you. (Applause)

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:55.902
(Applause)

00:12:55.902 --> 00:12:59.724
Thank you very much. (Applause)